(Dispatch actions: execute_schedule_dispatch (for schedule_candidate) requires dispatch_allocated ?candidate, candidate_vehicle_linked ?candidate ?vehicle_unit, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked ?candidate ?dispatch_slot, and not dispatched ?candidate.)
(So we need to allocate dispatch slot for candidate, allocate vehicle, link vehicle, link dispatch slot.)
(Also we need dispatch_ready ?candidate to be true before allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate (precondition includes dispatch_ready ?candidate). So we need to make candidate dispatch_ready.)
(How to get dispatch_ready? There are actions: mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready and mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready (these apply to origin_availability and destination_availability). Also there are finalize_candidate_* actions that produce dispatch_ready ?candidate.)
(Specifically:)
(- finalize_candidate_direct: precondition candidate_clearance_established ?candidate, not route_sequence_context_set ?candidate, not candidate_finalized ?candidate. Effect candidate_finalized ?candidate, dispatch_ready ?candidate.)
(- finalize_candidate_after_sequence_validation: precondition candidate_clearance_established ?candidate, route_sequence_validated ?candidate, not candidate_finalized ?candidate. Effect candidate_finalized ?candidate, dispatch_ready ?candidate.)
(- finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation: precondition compliance_validation_complete ?candidate, not candidate_finalized ?candidate. Effect candidate_finalized ?candidate, dispatch_ready ?candidate.)
(Thus we can get dispatch_ready for schedule_candidate via one of these finalize actions.)
(Alternatively, for origin_availability and destination_availability, we have mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready and mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready. Their preconditions: origin_availability_locked ?origin_availability, origin_availability_confirmed ?origin_availability, transport_leg_assembled ?transport_leg, transport_leg_loading_authorized ?transport_leg, not dispatched ?origin_availability. Effect dispatch_ready ?origin_availability.)
